WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.387
This query groups admissions by month.

00:00:02.387 --> 00:00:10.377
Inside each SUM, CASE contributes one when the row matches a selected diagnosis and zero otherwise.

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:13.947
The sum becomes the diagnosis count for that month.

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:18.752
Run the query and verify that each result row represents one month.

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:25.772
A pivot converts category values into columns, usually through conditional aggregation in portable SQL.

00:00:25.772 --> 00:00:29.402
Each target column needs a clear aggregation rule.

00:00:29.402 --> 00:00:34.902
Before pivoting, check whether the source contains more than one value for the same row-key and category

00:00:34.902 --> 00:00:36.280
combination.
